      "document_raw_hash": "aa0df88cb9de31947bf15bdd2ea2776762dae021725d26866b1aaf8b45c49943",
      "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield/",
      "url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield/#a-database-dependency-with-yield",
      "title": "Dependencies with yield",
      "heading_path": [
        "Dependencies with yield",
        "A database dependency with yield"
      ],
      "section_anchor": "a-database-dependency-with-yield",
      "variants": [],
      "callout": null,
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "end": 90,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 12
        },
        {
          "end": 96,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 13
        }
      ],
      "chunk_ids": [
        "14b47946-59dd-559c-a66c-752f41834bf1"
      ],
      "text": "For example, you could use this to create a database session and close it after finishing.\n\nOnly the code prior to and including the yield statement is executed before creating a response:",
      "partial_code": false,
      "expanded_code_blocks": [],
      "evidence_id": "E1"
    },
    {
      "snapshot_id": "279777ae-c949-4cae-8403-2224b314903f",
      "document_id": "71917cba-baa4-5909-a658-7bd5569c4a5b",
      "document_content_hash": "68b6cb32b3750c6cfff23b0f81d3a2fc1c938c578b88a76e00dbe2103fa70f5f",
      "document_raw_hash": "aa0df88cb9de31947bf15bdd2ea2776762dae021725d26866b1aaf8b45c49943",
      "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield/",
      "url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield/#a-dependency-with-yield-and-try",
      "title": "Dependencies with yield",
      "heading_path": [
        "Dependencies with yield",
        "A dependency with yield and try"
      ],
      "section_anchor": "a-dependency-with-yield-and-try",
      "variants": [],
      "callout": null,
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "end": 122,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 23
        },
        {
          "end": 223,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 24
        },
        {
          "end": 93,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 25
        },
        {
          "end": 122,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 26
        }
      ],
      "chunk_ids": [
        "7611e43f-0728-55fa-ad69-62fb90f3f812"
      ],
      "text": "If you use a try block in a dependency with yield, you'll receive any exception that was thrown when using the dependency.\n\nFor example, if some code at some point in the middle, in another dependency or in a path operation, made a database transaction \"rollback\" or created any other exception, you would receive the exception in your dependency.\n\nSo, you can look for that specific exception inside the dependency with except SomeException.\n\nIn the same way, you can use finally to make sure the exit steps are executed, no matter if there was an exception or not.",
      "partial_code": false,
      "expanded_code_blocks": [],
      "evidence_id": "E2"
    },
    {
      "snapshot_id": "279777ae-c949-4cae-8403-2224b314903f",
      "document_id": "71917cba-baa4-5909-a658-7bd5569c4a5b",
      "document_content_hash": "68b6cb32b3750c6cfff23b0f81d3a2fc1c938c578b88a76e00dbe2103fa70f5f",
      "document_raw_hash": "aa0df88cb9de31947bf15bdd2ea2776762dae021725d26866b1aaf8b45c49943",
      "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield/",
      "url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield/#dependencies-with-yield-and-httpexception",
      "title": "Dependencies with yield",
      "heading_path": [
        "Dependencies with yield",
        "Dependencies with yield and HTTPException"
      ],
      "section_anchor": "dependencies-with-yield-and-httpexception",
      "variants": [],
      "callout": null,
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "end": 141,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 53
        },
        {
          "end": 88,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 54
        },
        {
          "end": 69,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 55
        }
      ],
      "chunk_ids": [
        "67670635-3677-57af-a942-d9cb0cf5b499"
      ],
      "text": "You saw that you can use dependencies with yield and have try blocks that try to execute some code and then run some exit code after finally.\n\nYou can also use except to catch the exception that was raised and do something with it.\n\nFor example, you can raise a different exception, like HTTPException.",
      "partial_code": false,
      "expanded_code_blocks": [],
      "evidence_id": "E3"
    },
    {
      "snapshot_id": "279777ae-c949-4cae-8403-2224b314903f",
      "document_id": "71917cba-baa4-5909-a658-7bd5569c4a5b",
      "document_content_hash": "68b6cb32b3750c6cfff23b0f81d3a2fc1c938c578b88a76e00dbe2103fa70f5f",
      "document_raw_hash": "aa0df88cb9de31947bf15bdd2ea2776762dae021725d26866b1aaf8b45c49943",
      "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield/",
      "url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield/#sub-dependencies-with-yield",
      "title": "Dependencies with yield",
      "heading_path": [
        "Dependencies with yield",
        "Sub-dependencies with yield"
      ],
      "section_anchor": "sub-dependencies-with-yield",
      "variants": [],
      "callout": null,
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "end": 30,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 37
        },
        {
          "end": 128,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 38
        },
        {
          "end": 114,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 39
        }
      ],
      "chunk_ids": [
        "ef0af378-d818-5372-8e8f-36cacb936ae8"
      ],
      "text": "And all of them can use yield.\n\nIn this case dependency_c, to execute its exit code, needs the value from dependency_b (here named dep_b) to still be available.\n\nAnd, in turn, dependency_b needs the value from dependency_a (here named dep_a) to be available for its exit code.",
      "partial_code": false,
      "expanded_code_blocks": [],
      "evidence_id": "E4"
    },
    {
      "snapshot_id": "279777ae-c949-4cae-8403-2224b314903f",
      "document_id": "71917cba-baa4-5909-a658-7bd5569c4a5b",
      "document_content_hash": "68b6cb32b3750c6cfff23b0f81d3a2fc1c938c578b88a76e00dbe2103fa70f5f",
      "document_raw_hash": "aa0df88cb9de31947bf15bdd2ea2776762dae021725d26866b1aaf8b45c49943",
      "source_url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield/",
      "url": "https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield/#dependencies-with-yield",
      "title": "Dependencies with yield",
      "heading_path": [
        "Dependencies with yield"
      ],
      "section_anchor": "dependencies-with-yield",
      "variants": [],
      "callout": {
        "kind": "tip",
        "title": "Tip"
      },
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "end": 3,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 3
        },
        {
          "end": 54,
          "start": 0,
          "block_index": 4
        }
      ],
      "chunk_ids": [
        "ad0aa4ba-d34d-5048-a3a6-02478c28a681"
      ],
      "text": "Tip\n\nMake sure to use yield one single time per dependency.",
      "partial_code": false,
      "expanded_code_blocks": [],
